    AI Model means the algorithmic framework and software architecture, including any network structure, parameters, hyperparameters, and any related computational or decision-making logic, designed to process input data and generate output or predictions and incorporating or relying upon Model Weights, training data, and other methods to learn patterns, make inferences, or otherwise perform its intended functions.
    
