  I.5	Human Oversight 

    Human Oversight
    Provider undertakes and warrants that: 
    - the AI Feature has been and will continue to be designed and developed for the entire term of the Agreement with appropriate human-machine interface tools, in such a way that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons during the period in which the AI Feature is in use; 
    - the oversight measures and tools shall meet the requirements of Art 14 of the EU AI Act [and the AI Feature Requirements Specification].
    
    Kill Switch
    Customer shall be technically able, and is hereby authorized, to immediate deactivate any AI Feature if it reasonably believes that the Feature is producing non-compliant, biased, or unreliable outputs, or otherwise poses a material risk. In such cases, the Parties shall cooperate in good faith to investigate the issue and determine appropriate corrective measures.

	
